  "content": "你好世界![](https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_HEADER.png)  \n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #800080;\">&nbsp;適用於 Forge 1.16.5, 1.18.2, 1.19.2, 1.20.1</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #800080;\">NeoForge 1.21.1</span></p>  <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>必要模組：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Integrated API</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Create</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Quark</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Supplementaries</span></p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>可選整合模組：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Biomes O’ Plenty</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Alex’s Mobs</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Guard Villagers</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Artifacts</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Biomes You'll Go</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Regions Unexplored</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Terralith</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Waystones</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Farmer's Delight</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ice and Fire</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ars Nouveau</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Better Archeology</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\">![](https://i.imgur.com/g47qxf6.jpg)</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #800080;\"><strong><strong>什麼是整合地牢與結構？</strong></strong></span></h2>  \n\n    <span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 整合地牢與結構（又名IDAS）是一個模組，使用來自Quark、Alex's Mobs和Create的方塊與生物，添加了極具細節的結構，並可選整合許多其他模組。我厭倦了在整合包中安裝結構模組後，探索世界時只找到原版物品而且毫無難度。我熱愛精緻的建築和Create的機器，所以我決定製作一個模組，來補足我一直缺少的東西。美麗且充滿挑戰的地牢與結構，充滿了背景故事，並完全整合到多個核心Forge模組中。</span>\n\n  \n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;\">如果你是新玩家，我強烈建議你尋找迷宮、工匠工坊、遠古礦坑或掠奪者堡壘，並從頭到尾遊玩一次。這些結構花費了我最多的時間來建造，我相信它們真的非常有趣且回報豐厚。祝你好運！</span>\n\n  \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong>來看看我的其他專案！</strong></span>\n\n*   <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Minecraft</a>，整合結構系列的官方整合包</strong></span>\n*   <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #800080;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-stronghold\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Stronghold</a><br></strong></span>\n*   <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #800080;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Villages</a></strong></span>\n\n  \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>設定與可選整合：</strong></span>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>For 1.16</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">編輯設定檔<br>IDAS會自動偵測是否安裝了Ice and Fire，並會改變部分結構的戰利品和生物</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br><strong>For 1.18 and above</strong><br>若要啟用BOP整合，請下載此<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-bop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #36f; text-decoration: underline;\">資料包</span></span></a>。<br>若要啟用Alex's Mobs整合，請下載此<span style=\"color: #36f;\"><a style=\"color: #36f;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">資料包</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要設定其他項目，請下載此<span style=\"color: #36f;\"><a style=\"color: #36f;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">資料包</a></span></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要改變生成率，請修改結構集中的spacing（間距）和separation（分離度）。Spacing是兩次相鄰生成嘗試之間的平均距離。數值範圍介於0到4096之間。<br>Separation是兩個相鄰生成嘗試之間的最小區塊距離。數值範圍介於0到4096之間。不能大於spacing。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要編輯生態域，請編輯tags/worldgen/biome/has structure中的生態域檔案。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要停用結構，請從其標籤列表中移除所有生態域，或將separation和spacing設為極高的數值。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要改善與其他結構模組的相容性，請將結構加入每個worldgen/configured_structure_feature檔案中的「structure set to avoid」列表。</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>注意：</strong>使用全域資料包模組時，如果你同時使用BOP和設定資料包，你必須手動確保BOP整合的資料包位於設定資料包之上。</span></p></div>\n\n  \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>功能與計劃功能：</strong></strong></span>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>在主世界和地獄維度中擁有超過50個獨特且極具細節的結構，包括：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 20個獨特且精緻的世界建築結構，例如營地、市集、動物巢穴等等</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 7個終局等級的地牢，範圍從廣闊的矮人礦坑到沙漠迷宮，再到掠奪者堡壘</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; Create主題地牢，內含旋轉死亡陷阱，例如工匠工坊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 15間為疲憊旅人準備的獨特房屋與旅館</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;- 6座可供探索的魔法師與附魔塔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 沉沒的海盜船</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 村民城堡</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 地獄中的魔法塔與傳送門可供探索</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 事件型結構，例如冬季馬車與鬼魅莊園</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>計劃功能：</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 地下地牢變體</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 更多地獄與終界結構</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp;<strong>加入我的Discord以提出建議，並投票決定接下來要新增哪些結構！</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong>如果你找不到這些結構，只需在聊天欄中輸入 `<em>/locate idas</em>`，你應該會看到所有結構的清單。例如，輸入 `<em>/locate idas:castle</em>` 將會找到離你最近的城堡。</strong></span></p></div>\n\n  \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>所有結構圖片</strong></span>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>宏偉迷宮，由CraisinLord設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/563/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"429\" height=\"241\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/569/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"321\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>掠奪者堡壘，由CraisinLord設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/517/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"378\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/518/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"374\" height=\"374\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>遠古礦坑，由CraisinLord設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/716/2022-04-29_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"530\" height=\"298\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/717/2022-05-01_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"301\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/718/2022-05-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"299\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>巫師塔，由CraisinLord設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/570/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"412\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>附魔塔，由CraisinLord設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/734/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"557\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>廢棄房屋，由CraisinLord設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/565/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"548\" height=\"308\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/460/853/2022-05-10_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"309\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>城堡，由CraisinLord設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/568/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"553\" height=\"415\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/864/2022-08-26_14.png\" width=\"552\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1049/87/2024-12-24_20.png\" width=\"550\" height=\"289\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>磚房，由CraisinLord設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/735/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>小屋，由CraisinLord設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/736/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>鬼屋，由CraisinLord設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/566/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"546\" height=\"307\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/567/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"414\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>&nbsp;熊爪旅館，由Howester1984設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/402/2022-05-19_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"567\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/403/2022-05-19_16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>沉船，由CraisinLord設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/463/968/2022-05-22_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>獵人小屋，由Howester1984設計</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/465/540/2022-05-29_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"571\" height=\"321\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>農舍，由Howester1984設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/920/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/922/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/722/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"321\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>女巫樹樁，由Howester1984設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/155/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/156/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>隱士洞穴，由Howester1984設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/234/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/235/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>藥劑師小屋，由Howester1984設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/720/apothecary.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/721/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"588\" height=\"331\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>漁夫小屋，由Nirze設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/943/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/944/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>赤角公會，由Howester1984設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/225/2022-07-23_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>養蜂人家，由Howester1984設計</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/484/677/2022-08-09_09.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>樹頂酒館，由Howester1984和chloe2cu設計</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/485/811/2022-08-12_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>遠古傳送門，由CraisinLord和Nirze設計</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/947/5959975b-dbad-419d-85d3-5287742817ab.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/948/ed56c84f-9547-45a8-ada0-5bc5b05d95e1.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>工匠工坊，由CraisinLord和Howester1984設計</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/950/54124500-3512-4afe-b6f0-376fb5d72bd1.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/951/07e24ea0-43c8-4fdd-a387-1be8f8b9361c.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>死靈法師尖塔，由CraisinLord設計</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/735/2022-08-29_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>市集，由Howester1984設計</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/493/279/2022-09-05_11.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"><br>鬼魅莊園，由Howester1984設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/889/2022-10-20_15.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br>冬季馬車，由Howester1984設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/890/2022-12-23_19.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br></strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>不祥恐懼堡壘，由CraisinLord設計（僅限Ice and Fire）</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/610/735/2023-01-21_10.png\" width=\"583\" height=\"312\"></strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><br>樞紐，由Codex設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/641/934/2023-04-01_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\">此結構中的傳送門：<br></strong></strong></span></p><div><div><div><p>天境</p><p>暮光森林</p><p>Atum</p><p>地獄</p><p>Erebus / 深淵國度</p><p>Bumblezone</p><p>Eden ring</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>深海遺跡，由Howester1984設計</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/507/2023-05-26_11.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/508/2023-05-25_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></div><div><span styl